### Login (obtener JWT)
POST https://localhost:44395/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### Obtener todos los productos
GET https://localhost:44395/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener producto por ID
GET https://localhost:44395/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Crear producto
POST https://localhost:44395/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "ABC123",
  "name": "Laptop",
  "description": "Laptop de prueba",
  "price": 15000,
  "stock": 10,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### Obtener todas las categorías
GET https://localhost:44395/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Crear categoría
POST https://localhost:44395/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electrónica"
}

###

### Obtener todos los usuarios (solo Admin)
GET https://localhost:44395/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Crear usuario (solo Admin)
POST https://localhost:44395/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cliente1",
  "password": "cliente123",
  "role": "User",
  "email": "cliente1@correo.com"
}

###

### Crear orden
POST https://localhost:44395/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "createdAt": "2025-12-06T15:00:00Z",
  "total": 15000,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 15000
    }
  ]
}

###

### Obtener todas las órdenes (solo Admin)
GET https://localhost:44395/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener orden por ID
GET https://localhost:44395/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
